# Data processing
Feature filter VIF+REFCV.py  Two-stage feature selection: VIF (Variance Inflation Factor) filtering followed by RFECV (Recursive Feature Elimination with Cross-Validation) |
WorldClim bio variable extraction.py
Arcpy batch processing GEE download images.py

# Decay Rate Constant (K) Estimation
Global map of baseline decay rate constant K.py  Estimate and map baseline decay rate constant K globally
Global map of baseline decay rate constant K std.py  Baseline *K* mapping with uncertainty
Global map of future decay rate constant K.py  Project future decay rate constant *K* under climate scenarios
Global map of future decay rate constant K std.py.py  Future *K* mapping with uncertainty
Estimating differential decay rates of standing versus downed deadwood.py Calculate decomposition rate differences between standing and downed deadwood

# Carbon Flux Calculation
Carbon flux fate calculation.py Calculate carbon fate partitioning (C retention, C emission, C sequestration) 
Carbon flux fate std calculation.py Carbon fate calculation with uncertainty propagation 
Carbon release of fungal functional groups.py Estimate carbon release by white-rot and brown-rot functional groups 

# Fungal Community Analysis
Fungal richness statistics by forest type.p  Calculate fungal species richness aggregated by forest type and region
Competition intensity of fungal functional groups.py  Calculate competition intensity between fungal functional groups
